2.2 Architectural separation

World Chat must remain operational independently of the financial execution layer.

Card Conduit must not independently authorize payments.

Xenograph Analytics may analyze transaction events but must not possess unrestricted authority to change balances, release funds, or determine ownership.

The Integrity Ledger records and verifies evidence but does not independently establish the truth of external claims.

Governance services define who can perform privileged actions and how those actions are reviewed.

