- Simultaneous bid ordering.
- Tie-breaking.
- Cancellation.
- Failed-payment handling.
- Seller fees.
- Platform fees.
- Asset delivery.
- Dispute procedures.

9.3 Integrity controls

- Server-authoritative bid validation.
- Consistent time handling.
- Idempotent bid submission.
- Ordered bid records.
- Authorization checks.
- Asset reservation.
- Payment obligation creation.
- Reconciliation.

Private bidder information must not be published unnecessarily.

